      "text": "Projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
